  "name": "Pokémon Art Academy × Pokémon Card Game Contest",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "In the Japanese Pokémon Art Academy × Pokémon Card Game contest, entrants drew card designs in the game Pokémon Art Academy, from 13 December 2014 to 1 February 2015, and the winners were announced in March 2015. Ten winning designs, five from the Dress-Up Pikachu category and five from Your Favorite Pokémon (Goomy, Sableye, Gourgeist, Mudkip and a Pikachu), were printed as XY promos, and each winner received 100 copies of their own card.",
